title AVG-04 Approve Application and Register Service in AVG
fontsize 20
gap 180
participant Checker_or_Client_Admin
participant Zetrix_Registry_Admin
participant DNS_Resolver
participant AVG
participant Zetrix_HSM
participant SSIVC
participant MBI
participant Zetrix_Registry
==REVIEW==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:approve application
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:approver is not creator or last editor
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->DNS_Resolver:re-check DNS TXT record
DNS_Resolver-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:found
==GO LIVE==
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:create Service record Active
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->AVG:register service (required credential, allowed claims, callback URL)
AVG-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:API key + HMAC signing secret (key hashed, secret encrypted)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_HSM:create service did:zid and did:oan key pairs
Zetrix_HSM-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:public keys (private keys stay in HSM)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->SSIVC:issue Service Cert (service did:zid, approver = registry controller)
SSIVC->MBI:issue VC with Service Cert template
MBI-->SSIVC:Service Cert ID, validUntil
SSIVC-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:Service Cert ID, validUntil
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Zetrix_Registry:create listing + OpenAgenet mirror (async, AVG-08)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:approved; API key + signing secret shown once
alt SELF-APPROVAL OR TXT RECORD MISSING
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:approval blocked
end
alt SERVICE CERT ISSUE FAILS
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:service stays Active in AVG; cert issue failed, Retry
end
alt REGISTRY SYNC FAILS
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:service stays Active in AVG; listing sync failed, Retry
end
